      "widgets_values": [
        "Photoreal continuation of the input still. Begin on the locked composition of the first frame, then execute a smooth cinematic push-in toward the main subject over several seconds. Micro-motion only: gentle parallax, soft light shifts, fabric or foliage stir if present, natural ambient life in the background. Preserve subject identity, materials, and lighting direction from the still. Steady camera, continuous motion, no jump cuts. Soft environmental ambience\u2014distant city hush or light wind\u2014without dialogue."
      ],
